sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Server start
  participant D as Database
  participant S as SMTP relay
  participant Y as You
  A->>A: AUTH_MODE=strict-managed: check PUBLIC_BASE_URL, ADMIN_CONTACT_EMAIL, SMTP
  A->>D: an admin with that address already?
  alt yes
    D-->>A: done, no email
  else no
    A->>D: create the admin account (or clear an existing non-admin one), no password
    A->>S: set-password email
    S-->>Y: link = PUBLIC_BASE_URL/… (24 h, once)
    Note over A,D: email failed → undo, refuse to start
  end
